      <title>孩子529账户有10万美元，牛市该转投股票吗？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260820/%E5%AD%A9%E5%AD%90529%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%9C%8910%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%89%9B%E5%B8%82%E8%AF%A5%E8%BD%AC%E6%8A%95%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E5%90%97/</link>
